    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>You\u2019re a retired hero - now it\u2019s your job to prepare a village to survive without you.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tired of Being the Hero</strong> is a first-person fantasy action RPG with a management twist. As a retired hero, lead and train your villagers to stand against relentless monster attacks. Assign roles, motivate your team, upgrade townsfolk, unlock powerful abilities, and adapt your strategy to outlast the next assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.poster.avif?t=1753575179\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.webm?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/2c40e5bfc9b2d4f352e22ea28a6b3b44.mp4?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience Retirement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.poster.avif?t=1753575179\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.webm?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/1a0d8b2e5d37790e81ed3ee710e3b9fc.mp4?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your story with a career change from a renowned hero to a peaceful woodsman.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Give Your Villagers Names</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.poster.avif?t=1753575179\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.webm?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/95cf9bda34d875add78367b7b9efc483.mp4?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Get to know the locals of the village and give them nicknames to form a closer bond.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Up and Motivate Your Allies by Raising Morale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.poster.avif?t=1753575179\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.webm?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/ab0efd9fdc637925ae916c0f19a95ecb.mp4?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight and protect the villagers to raise morale. Spend that morale to increase their level. Teach them new abilities, change their roles, and work together to survive.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test Your Villagers Against Powerful Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.poster.avif?t=1753575179\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.webm?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849030/extras/cb06bc435e87bf105ab05ed66612cd8f.mp4?t=1753575179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger and more dangerous enemies will threaten your villagers.</p>",
